  "text": "hi sry typing fast. jonah is 4, has epilepsy. if he has a seizure time it, if it goes past 5 min call 911 and give the nasal spray (valtoco) its in the red bag. most last under 2 min. he used to take keppra but the neuro stopped it in june, hes on lamotrigine now (we give it at home, u dont need to give any daily meds). no allergies. he sleeps hard after a seizure, let him sleep",
